{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46222","headline":"贺雨上王使君二首 一 · 贯休","name":"贺雨上王使君二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一片丹心合万灵，应时甘雨带龙腥。\n驱尘煞烧连穷□，□电冲霓满窅冥。\n处处已知仓廪溢，家家皆歇管弦听。\n应须蚤勒南山石，黄霸清风满内庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}